<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">**Add
personal introduction**</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">I so appreciate your support with hosting drives
already. On behalf of patients and their loved ones, thank you! We value your
commitment as a Blood Program Leader to host drives when they are needed most.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">While blood is needed every day to save lives,
we must recruit more heavily during certain times of the year to combat fewer
donations when people are busy. Vacation travel, back-to-school activities,
holiday get-togethers and more plans prevent donors from making time to give.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Patients are still counting on us.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Schedule
your upcoming blood drives now!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Plan a blood drive around a critical
     holiday theme to encourage participation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">To help get donors in the door, we have
     great incentives to encourage them to show up for those in need. Spread
     the word!<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color: red; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">[Add if May]</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Memorial Day<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">We honor all those for their service as well as
the actions of everyday heroes – like blood donors. Your generosity saves
lives! Please host a blood drive in the spirit of service to help those in
need. Promote our <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[item]</span>
gift to incentivize donors to give during this critical time.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">[Add if June/July]</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Independence Day<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Celebrate Independence Day by encouraging donors
to make a life-changing donation for patients across the country. Please host a
blood drive to ensure there’s enough blood available throughout the busy summer
months. Promote our <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[item]</span>
gift to incentivize donors to give during this critical time.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">[Add if August/September]</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Labor Day<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">As summer wraps up and kids head back to school,
we know schedules shift and blood donors are busy. The Red Cross is reminding
donors that blood for patients can only come from volunteer donors. Please make
time to host a drive to ensure blood is available for patients this fall.
Promote our farewell summer gift, <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:
yellow">[item]</span>, to incentivize donors to give during this critical time.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">[Add if October/November]</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Thanksgiving<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">While we settle back into fall routines, donors
are asked to book a time to give blood or platelets before busy fall schedules
and holiday celebrations ramp up. Give thanks and give back! Please host a
blood drive in the spirit of giving back and helping those in need have hope
this season. Promote our gift of thanks, <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">[item]</span>, to incentivize donors to give during this
critical time.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">[Add if November/December]</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Winter holiday season<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Give something that means something. Patients
are counting on the generosity of volunteer blood donors to make giving blood a
favorite holiday tradition. This winter, join in the holiday spirit by hosting
a blood drive. Promote our <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[item]</span>
gift to incentivize donors to give during this critical time.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Let’s get your critical blood drive planned and
get donors excited to make a difference when it’s most needed.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Best regards,</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Name]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Title]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader">













































































</p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Email]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
